{"lesson":{"title":"A Perfect Split Step Can Be Late","hook":"Your split step looks correct, yet the first move still begins after the ball is gone.","memHTML":"Land <span>for the hit.</span>","tomorrow":"Next time you rally, sync your split to their strike and land ready to push as direction appears.","pro":{"player":"The research","label":"What the split step buys","moment":"In a lab study of a simulated tennis reaction task, participants reached the target faster when they split-stepped: 764 ms on average, against 868 ms without.","read":"About a tenth of a second, bought with timing, not speed.","src":"Journal of Sports Sciences, 2009","url":"https://lida.sport-iat.de/twm/Record/4017156?lng=en"},"drill":{"name":"Land on \"hit\"","how":"Your partner feeds from both sides. Say \"hit\" out loud as they strike the ball, and land your split on the word. Twenty balls, then rally."},"cue":"Land as they hit.","callbackTags":["split_step"],"finaleScene":"ss2","steps":[{"ph":"See · Read the beat","short":"See","name":"Land, settle, then go","scene":"ss1","reveal":true,"sit":"You reach your spot. Watch the split step and your first move.","q":"Where does the rhythm break?","opts":["The split carries you off line","You land, then pause before moving","You push off while still in the air","You move after they've hit"],"correct":1,"payoff":"You landed too early, then had to start again.","principle":"Land as their shot becomes readable, so the landing turns into your first step.","why":"Here you land well before they hit, settle, and restart. Landing just after their contact lets the landing feed the first push.","rail":["1 Racket prepares","2 Feet and contact","3 First move"],"cues":null,"unlock":"The landing beat matters","take":"Watch LAND, then THEIR HIT: land too early and you have to start again.","lines":{"A":"The split lands where it started — it doesn't carry you off line.","B":"Right — you land, settle, and only then start again. That pause costs time.","C":"Both feet are down before you go — the push isn't in the air.","D":"Moving after their hit is normal. The pause before it isn't."}},{"ph":"Deepen · Align the cue","short":"Deepen","name":"Land just after the hit","scene":"ss2","reveal":true,"sit":"Same spot, same shot. Watch what changes.","q":"What removed the pause?","opts":["Wider feet at landing","A quicker push from the same landing","Landing just after their hit","Starting closer to the ball"],"correct":2,"payoff":"You land just after their hit and go as the ball becomes readable.","principle":"Time the landing to their contact, not to your own rhythm.","why":"Nothing else changed: same spot, same push. Landing just after their hit means there's no settled pause.","rail":["1 Racket prepares","2 Feet and contact","3 First move"],"cues":null,"unlock":"Land ready for the read","take":"Land just after their hit and push as it becomes readable.","lines":{"A":"The landing is no wider — only its timing moved.","B":"The push isn't quicker — it just starts sooner after the hit.","C":"Right — you land just after their hit, so there's no pause.","D":"Same spot as before — only the timing changed."}},{"ph":"Transfer · Change the tempo","short":"Transfer","name":"Their shorter swing","scene":"ss3","noTargets":true,"sit":"They shorten their swing. With your old rhythm, the ball gets past you.","q":"What do you change on the next ball?","opts":["Wait to see where it goes","A smaller split","Same split, push harder","Same split, a beat sooner"],"correct":3,"payoff":"A quicker swing needs an earlier split, not a harder push.","principle":"Match your split to their swing, whatever its speed.","why":"Their shorter swing brings the hit forward. Starting the same split sooner puts your landing back on their contact; pushing harder or splitting smaller can't win back the time.","rail":["1 Shorter swing","2 You land late","3 Next ball"],"cues":null,"unlock":"Adapt the rhythm","take":"A quicker swing? Start the same split sooner, so you land as they hit.","lines":{"A":"Waiting for the direction, then splitting — the ball is past you.","B":"A smaller split pushes weaker — the ball gets past you.","C":"Still landing late — a harder push can't make it up.","D":"Split a beat sooner — you land as it's readable and get there."}}]},"scenes":{"ss1":{"ball":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[-0.9327,11.5141,0.7901],[-0.8657,11.2297,0.8399],[-0.799,10.9468,0.888],[-0.7327,10.6653,0.9346],[-0.6667,10.3853,0.9795],[-0.6011,10.1067,1.0227],[-0.5358,9.8295,1.0644],[-0.4708,9.5537,1.1045],[-0.4062,9.2793,1.143],[-0.3419,9.0062,1.18],[-0.2779,8.7345,1.2154],[-0.2142,8.4642,1.2493],[-0.1508,8.1952,1.2816],[-0.0877,7.9275,1.3124],[-0.025,7.6612,1.3417],[0.0375,7.3961,1.3695],[0.0996,7.1323,1.3959],[0.1614,6.8698,1.4207],[0.223,6.6086,1.4441],[0.2842,6.3486,1.466],[0.3452,6.0899,1.4865],[0.4058,5.8323,1.5056],[0.4662,5.576,1.5232],[0.5263,5.321,1.5394],[0.5861,5.0671,1.5542],[0.6457,4.8144,1.5676],[0.7049,4.5629,1.5796],[0.7639,4.3125,1.5903],[0.8226,4.0633,1.5995],[0.881,3.8153,1.6074],[0.9392,3.5684,1.614],[0.9971,3.3227,1.6192],[1.0547,3.078,1.6231],[1.1121,2.8345,1.6256],[1.1692,2.5921,1.6268],[1.226,2.3508,1.6267],[1.2826,2.1106,1.6254],[1.3389,1.8715,1.6227],[1.395,1.6334,1.6187],[1.4508,1.3964,1.6134],[1.5064,